# Steady state: after start, a packet is released only when the OPPOSING stream has already delivered a packet
# with a higher dts_usec; one packet is sent per arriving packet. The queue is sorted by dts_usec and, for equal
# dts_usec, a video packet is placed before audio packets already queued.
video 30 1 1280 720
audio 48000
venc v
aenc a frame_size=1024
out o av,encoded autobegin=1
set_venc o v
set_aenc o a
start o
emit a 0 0 0 4
emit a 1024 1024 0 4
emit v 0 0 1 4
emit a 2048 2048 0 4
state o
echo --- audio far ahead (up to 128000us): video packets stream out one per arrival
emit a 3072 3072 0 4
emit a 4096 4096 0 4
emit a 5120 5120 0 4
emit a 6144 6144 0 4
queue o
emit v 1 1 0 4
emit v 2 2 0 4
queue o
echo --- video far ahead: audio is held back until video passes it, then released one by one
emit v 3 3 0 4
emit v 4 4 0 4
emit v 5 5 0 4
queue o
emit v 6 6 0 4
queue o
stop o
queue o
